Error [E1355]: this project declares env.dev; `jet test run.jet` is not running inside its verified environment
 Why: Jetpack preparation is disabled for this command. `jet run` delegates the declared environment unless `--no-prepare` is supplied; other verbs must be invoked through the existing Jetpack environment boundary.
 Fix: For `jet run`, remove `--no-prepare` and retry `jet test run.jet`; for another verb, run `jetpack env -- jet test run.jet`.
 Import: `use helper` is the package import that requires this environment.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1355
